; Restricted-network slice for Seatbelt profiles when Workspace owns a
; private network and reaches out only through the host Egress bridge.
;
; Do NOT allow ``localhost:*`` here — that would open every loopback port and
; defeat ``allowed_hosts`` / per-port egress. Concrete ``127.0.0.1``, ``::1``,
; ``localhost:<port>``, and peer ``127.0.0.X`` endpoints are appended by
; ``generate_seatbelt_profile``.
;
; This file is intentionally rules-free: loaded for stable structure /
; documentation next to the base policy.
